OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham has a lot of Irish
OL,4,Aroots - will he play on them during his
OL,5,Avisit?
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham was quick
OL,8,Fto talk up his proud Irish roots on his
OL,9,Flast visit to Northern Ireland and we
OL,10,Fcan expect more of the same this time.
OL,12,FBack then, the Mayor of Manchester was
OL,13,Fstill plotting his route to
OL,14,FWestminister when he addressed the
OL,15,FAlliance Party conference in March.
OL,17,F"If only my ancestors who left Drogheda
OL,18,Ffor Liverpool in the late 1800s could
OL,19,Fsee me now," he told delegates in
OL,20,FBelfast before going on to say: "It's
OL,21,Fnice to feel wanted by a political
OL,22,Fparty."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
