OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham has a lot of Irish
OL,4,Aroots - will he play on them during his
OL,5,Avisit?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThat was a pointed dig at the then
OL,8,FPrime Minister Sir Keir Starmer who was
OL,9,Ftrying to block Burnham's pathway to No
OL,10,F10.
